<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Whellingnorther Alliance -->
  <WNA_FactionWNA.label>威灵诺德联合会</WNA_FactionWNA.label>
  <!-- EN: Thousands of years ago a trace of unusual darkness appeared in the sky, since then these black-hooded figure and the army under their command have ravaged around this rimworld, until some time ago they suddenly decide to shrink their influence back into their outposts and facilities.\n\nIt's widly believed the Whelingnorther Alliance origins from a far distant Midworld long time ago, when its first generation members were seeking a new ideology different from any present, they were finally found by an ultimate truth. In a short time that Midworld was conquered by darkness and Whelingnorther Alliance began to spread their activities across the known universe.\n\nRecently they seem to be becoming active again and preparing to achieve their ultimate goal - the Whelingnorther Apocalypse. -->
  <WNA_FactionWNA.description>数千年前，一丝不寻常的黑暗痕迹出现在天空中，从那时起这些披着黑斗篷的人形以及他们指挥下的军队肆虐整个边缘世界，直到某段时间之前他们突然决定将影响力收缩回他们的哨站和设施中。\n\n人们普遍认为，威灵诺德联合会起源于很久之前的一个中寰世界，当时其初代成员试图寻求一种不同于现存任何理念的意识形态，最终却被某种超然的真理发现。眨眼间这个中寰世界便被黑暗征服，威灵诺德联合会开始将他们的影响力扩张到整个已知宇宙。\n\n最近他们似乎重新开始活跃，准备实现他们的终极目标——威灵天启。</WNA_FactionWNA.description>
  <!-- EN: Whellingnorther Alliance -->
  <WNA_FactionWNA.fixedName>威灵诺德联合会</WNA_FactionWNA.fixedName>
  <!-- EN: "When early ancestors of humanity rose from the humble, it was their effort and sacrifices that led to the prosperity of today world; when our predecessors rose from the insignificance, it was their effort and sacrifices that led to we Whelingnorther Alliance. Any great work requires sacrifices to forge, without great destruction can there be no great rebirth, without great devotions will we not achieve eternity salvation and immortality. We descendants shall follow the path led by those who came before us; we will see our duty and accept our manifest destiny; we shall alter and determine the past, the present and the future. All any existance shall bath in the glory of Whelignorther, they need not understand, only shall they obey." -->
  <WNA_FactionWNA.ideoDescription>“昔日人类先民起于微末之中，正是他们用奋力与牺牲换来了今日世界的繁荣；昔日我等前人崛起草芥之中，正是他们的奋力与牺牲成就了今日的威灵诺德联合会。一切伟大之作都需以牺牲铸就，没有伟大的毁灭便没有伟大的新生，没有伟大的奉献便无从寻求永恒自在不朽。我等后人当遵行前人引领的道路，我等明晰我等将负的重负，欣然接受我等的昭昭天命，我等将决定过往、当下与未来。一切存在之物都将沐浴威灵诺德的荣光，它们无需理解，它们必将服从。”</WNA_FactionWNA.ideoDescription>
  <!-- EN: Whelingnorther Holyorder -->
  <WNA_FactionWNA.ideoName>威灵圣教序</WNA_FactionWNA.ideoName>
